# src/packages/control-ui/tests/e2e

## Purpose
Provides browser-level end-to-end coverage for critical Control UI user journeys and remediation regressions.

## Contents
Contains Playwright specifications and supporting fixtures/routes that exercise rendered UI behavior through browser interactions.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Runs through Playwright against the Control UI and controlled HTTP/API route mocks or test services.

## Invariants
Mocks must match the real request paths/methods they characterize, tests must await user-observable readiness rather than arbitrary timing, each case isolates browser/network state, and production security behavior is not weakened to satisfy tests.